            "detailed_description": "Add action game and mahjong game, then do not divide by 2!<br />\r\nA game that forcibly merged action game and mahjong appeared!<br />\r\nOf course, since it is Mahjong, up to 4 players are allowed.<br />\r\nHands that cannot be made normally can dramatically be made, every player can become a winner, and gameplay is excellent too!<br />\r\nA lot of new strategies that were not in Mahjong are included, so a new page...even a new chapter is added to the history of Mahjong!",
            "about_the_game": "Add action game and mahjong game, then do not divide by 2!<br />\r\nA game that forcibly merged action game and mahjong appeared!<br />\r\nOf course, since it is Mahjong, up to 4 players are allowed.<br />\r\nHands that cannot be made normally can dramatically be made, every player can become a winner, and gameplay is excellent too!<br />\r\nA lot of new strategies that were not in Mahjong are included, so a new page...even a new chapter is added to the history of Mahjong!",
            "short_description": "Don't draw the tiles you want! Push and get them! A new mahjong game that goes beyond mahjong, a mah-jong game that will play the most exciting and make the biggest noise ever in history, is here at last!",
